3 LONG TITLE
4 General Description:
5 This bill addresses guardians ad litem and consideration of a minor's best interest.
6 Highlighted Provisions:
7 This bill:
8 ▸ makes modifications to the Guardian ad Litem Oversight Committee;
9 ▸ requires an attorney guardian ad litem to communicate a minor's expressed interests to a court;
1 1 ▸ modifies the responsibilities of the director of the Office of Guardian ad Litem;
1 2 ▸ requires an attorney guardian ad litem to represent the expressed interest of a minor that is
at least 12 years old, rather than the minor's best interest;
1 2 ▸ requires an attorney guardian ad litem to inform the court at each hearing of:
1 3 the minor's expressed wishes; and
●
1 4 the date of the attorney guardian ad litem's last interaction with the minor;
●
1 5 ▸ addresses when a guardian ad litem is appointed;
1 6 ▸ adjusts the responsibilities and obligations of {a } an attorney guardian ad litem;
1 7 ▸ {addresses records in child welfare cases;}
