350 78A-2-702. Definitions.
321 (1) As used in this part:
322 [(1)] (a) "Attorney guardian ad litem" means an attorney employed by the office.
323 [(2)] (b) "Director" means the director of the office.
354 (c) "Expressed interest" means the same as that term is defined in Section 80-1-102.
